* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore

# Manuskript source files carry their original line endings; the importer
# normalizes them itself. Left to the default `eol=lf` above, checkout would
# silently rewrite this fixture's CRLF and its line-ending test would pass
# vacuously against an already-normalized file.
tests/Fixtures/manuskript/** -text
